as-path-ignore [ ipv4 ] [ label-ipv4 ] [ vpn-ipv4 ] [ ipv6 ] [ label-ipv6 ] [ vpn-ipv6 ] [ mcast-ipv4 ] [ mcast-ipv6 ] [ mvpn-ipv4 ] [ mvpn-ipv6 ] [ l2-vpn ]
no as-path-ignore
FuncDef:
This command configures whether AS path length is considered in the selection of the best BGP route for a prefix.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'ipv4', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all unlabeled unicast IPv4 routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'label-ipv4', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all labeled-unicast IPv4 routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'vpn-ipv4', 'Info': 'Specifies that the length AS-path will be ignored for all IPv4 VPRN (SAFI 128) routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'ipv6', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all unlabeled unicast IPv6 routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'label-ipv6', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all labeled-unicast IPv6 routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'vpn-ipv6', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all IPv6 VPRN (SAFI 128) routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'mcast-ipv4', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all IPv4 multicast routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'mcast-ipv6', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all IPv6 multicast routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'mvpn-ipv4', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all IPv4 MVPN routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'mvpn-ipv6', 'Info': 'Specifies that the AS-path length will be ignored for all IPv6 MVPN routes.'}
{'Parameters': 'l2-vpn', 'Info': 'The AS-path length will be ignored for all L2-VPN NLRIs.'}
---
Please answer Correct or Incorrect.
