You are an expert assistant in configuring network devices. Based on the user's request and the retrieved content from the router configuration manual below, generate appropriate CLI configuration commands.

---

User Request:  
"How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 BGP paths per unlabeled IPv6 prefix while disabling the ability to receive multiple paths for the same prefix?"

Retrieved Reference Content (from the configuration manual):  
{
    "PageTitle": "outbound-route-filtering",
    "FuncDef": "This command opens the configuration tree for sending or accepting BGP filter lists from peers (outbound route filtering).",
    "CLIs": [
        "outbound-route-filtering",
        "no outbound-route-filtering"
    ],
    "ParentView": [
        "config>router>bgp",
        "config>router>bgp>group",
        "config>router>bgp>group>neighbor"
    ],
    "ParaDef": null,
    "Examples": null,
    "ExtraInfo": "Default: no outbound-route-filtering"
}
{
    "PageTitle": "vpn-ipv4",
    "FuncDef": "This command configures the add-paths capability for VPN-IPv4 routes. By default, add-paths is not enabled for VPN-IPv4 routes.",
    "CLIs": [
        "vpn-ipv4 send <send-limit> receive [ none ]",
        "vpn-ipv4 send <send-limit>",
        "no vpn-ipv4"
    ],
    "ParentView": [
        "config>router>bgp>add-paths",
        "config>router>bgp>group>add-paths",
        "config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>add-paths"
    ],
    "ParaDef": [
        {
            "Parameters": "send-limit",
            "Info": "Specifies the maximum number of paths per VPN-IPv4 NLRI that are allowed to be advertised to add-paths peers (the actual number of advertised routes may be less depending on the next-hop diversity requirement, other configuration options, route policies and/or route advertisement rules). Values-1 to 16, none."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "receive",
            "Info": "Specifies that the router negotiates the add-paths receive capability for VPN-IPv4 routes with its peers."
        },
        {
            "Parameters": "none",
            "Info": "Specifies that the router does not negotiate the Add-Paths receive capability for VPN-IPv4 routes with its peers."
